\left( {\cal R}_{e}\left( {\cal A}\right) \right) ^{t}}\right] -i\left[ 
\stackrel{}{%
%TCIMACRO{\func{Re}}%
%BeginExpansion
\mathop{\rm Re}%
%EndExpansion
\left( {\cal R}_{e}\left( {\cal A}\right) \right) ,%
%TCIMACRO{\func{Im}}%
%BeginExpansion
