\left[ {\cal R}_{e}\left( {\cal A}\right) ,{\cal R}_{e}\left( {\cal A}%
\right) ^{\dagger }\right] =0.
\end{equation}
\end{proof} The commutator of $A$ and $A^{\dagger }$ gives 
